# Optional: Gemini API key baked into the build as a fallback
# (copy this file to .env and uncomment). Users normally enter their key in
# the extension's Settings dialog instead; a key stored there takes
# precedence over this one.
#
# Note: the variable stays commented out here because Quarto treats any
# uncommented name in .env.example as *required* and refuses to render.
#
# API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
